# outline_ray.sm -- A hole level with the end of an arc of an outline
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# Fuzzer finding: the inside test missed the crossing at the end of the
# arc, and the hole was rejected.
sheet 1 1 0.4
plate p 0 0 100 50 origin 0 0 0 axes +x +y
outline along z
point 60 10.1
point 70 10.1 arc 70 15.3 ccw
point 70 20.5
point 60 20.5 arc 60 15.3 ccw
hole 2 30 10.1 along z
